<title>INDIA: Hindalco 97/98 capex at 5.5 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>Hindalco 97/98 capex at 5.5 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Hindalco Industries Ltd. said on Wednesday that it anticipated a capital expenditure of 5.50 billion rupees in financial year 1997/98 (April-March).</p>
<p>Chairman Kumar Mangalam Birla made the remarks at the firm's annual general meeting in reply to a shareholder's question.  </p>
<p>&quot;We also estimate a capital expenditure of 850 million rupees in 1998/99,&quot; Birla added.</p>
<p>--Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
